      # List a Pinterest account's boards
      #
      # List the boards of an active Pinterest account (up to 250), read from Pinterest (the same list is reused for up to a minute; a board made with accounts_set_board shows at once). `defaultBoardId` is the board Pins go to when a post sets no `options.pinterest.boardId`; it is `null` until one is picked, and the account then has the `BOARD_NOT_SELECTED` health warning. Ask the user which board to use and call accounts_set_board. An account with a single board gets it as the default at connect. Other platforms return 400.
      #
      # MCP tool: `accounts_list_boards`. Key scope: `accounts:read`.
