      # Set the board Pins go to when a post sets no `options.pinterest.boardId`: pass `boardId` (from accounts_list_boards), or `newBoardName` to create a public board and use it. Ampost checks the board with Pinterest first. The choice survives a reconnect. Returns the account; `platformMetadata.boardId` and `boardName` show the default. Other platforms return 400.
