      #
      # MCP tool: `queue_update`. Key scope: `posts:write`.
      #
      # `PATCH /api/platform-sets/{platformSetId}/queue`
      #
      # @param platform_set_id [String]
      # @param body [Hash, nil] The request body (`UpdateQueueRequest`), with the API's field names as keys.
      # @option body [String] :timezone IANA time zone the slot times are in, for example Europe/Warsaw. Slots follow its daylight saving changes.
